<p class="textAlign-center fontSize-large">👋</p>

<p>You can <a href="{{ `mailto:${metadata.author.email}`.split('').map((c) => `&#${c.charCodeAt(0)};`).join('') }}" class="u-email">email me</a>, or you can find <a href="{{ social.mastodon.url }}">me on Mastodon</a>. While I am also on LinkedIn for <em>Professional Reasons™</em>, I don’t use it all that often.</p>